 
 ordering food on Swiggy — from opening the app to completing payment

1. Open the Swiggy app.
2. Select your location.
3. Search for a restaurant or food item.
4. Select the food item.
5. Add the food item to the cart.
6. Review the order and check the total amount.
7. Enter or select the delivery address.
8. Select a payment method.
9. Complete the payment.
10. Confirm the order.
11. Receive the order confirmation.
